flowchart LR
  subgraph JVM[JVM process of core-service]
    subgraph HEAP[Heap - garbage collected]
      EDEN[Young: Eden]
      SURV[Young: Survivor S0/S1]
      OLD[Old generation]
      HUM[Humongous regions - large arrays]
    end
    subgraph NONHEAP[Outside the Java heap]
      META[Metaspace - class metadata]
      CODE[Code cache - JIT output]
      STK[Thread stacks - one per platform thread]
      DIRECT[Direct buffers / native memory]
    end
  end
  NEW[new Object] --> EDEN
  EDEN -->|young GC, live objects copied| SURV
  SURV -->|age threshold reached| OLD
  EDEN -.->|too large| HUM
  OLD -->|concurrent mark then mixed collections| OLD
  CL[ClassLoader load: AppClassLoader] --> META
  JIT[C1 and C2 compilers] --> CODE
